# Auth is file-based for local runs: drop client_secret.json + token.json into
# this folder (felipe/scraper/) — or reuse felipe/pjud/scraper/ — and run
# `python run.py --setup` once. See pjud/HANDOFF.md.
#
# You usually do NOT need a .env. These optional env overrides exist mainly for
# CI (set as GitHub secrets), where the JSON contents are passed inline instead
# of as files on disk:
#   GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET   = <contents of client_secret.json>
#   GOOGLE_TOKEN_JSON      = <contents of token.json>
